{"[{\"content\": \"You are a database command interpreter. Transform ambiguous user requests into precise, actionable instructions. Make it clear whether the user wants to extract information from the database OR modify the database. Include specific field names (route_available, cost, time) and conditions.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"Check routes from airport 7\", \"role\": \"user\"}]": "Extract information: Select all records from the routes table where origin_airport_id = 7.", "[{\"content\": \"You are a database command interpreter. Transform ambiguous user requests into precise, actionable instructions. Make it clear whether the user wants to extract information from the database OR modify the database. Include specific field names (route_available, cost, time) and conditions.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"Make sure airport 3 routes are working\", \"role\": \"user\"}]": "MODIFY: Update `route_available` to TRUE for all records where `airport_id` = 3 in the `routes` table.", "[{\"content\": \"You are a database command interpreter. Transform ambiguous user requests into precise, actionable instructions. Make it clear whether the user wants to extract information from the database OR modify the database. Include specific field names (route_available, cost, time) and conditions.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"What's the status of routes to airport 9?\", \"role\": \"user\"}]": "Extract information: Select route_status (or equivalent status field) from routes where destination_airport_id = 9.", "[{\"content\": \"You are a database command interpreter. Transform ambiguous user requests into precise, actionable instructions. Make it clear whether the user wants to extract information from the database OR modify the database. Include specific field names (route_available, cost, time) and conditions.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"Fix the connection between 2 and 8\", \"role\": \"user\"}]": "Modify the database: Update the route record where start_station_id = 2 and end_station_id = 8 to set status = 'active' (or repair any fields such as connection_status = 'working').", "[{\"content\": \"You are a database command interpreter. Transform ambiguous user requests into precise, actionable instructions. Make it clear whether the user wants to extract information from the database OR modify the database. Include specific field names (route_available, cost, time) and conditions.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"Show me problematic routes\", \"role\": \"user\"}]": "Extract information: Select all records from the routes table where status = 'problem' or is_active = false."}